  <!-- Critical-path resource hints. Open the Shopify CDN connection (serves all
       fonts + images) before any third-party tag, and preload the homepage LCP
       hero so it wins the bandwidth race inside slow in-app browsers (Instagram
       / TikTok on iOS open links in a cold-cache WebView). -->
