  {%- capture seo_description -%}
    {%- if template == 'index' -%}Skincare and telehealth for people with fungus-prone skin. Malassezia-safe formulas, an ingredient checker, and a clinician-backed handbook covering fungal acne, seborrheic dermatitis, dandruff, and tinea versicolor.
    {%- elsif page.handle == 'roflumilast' -%}Educational guide to how roflumilast and Zoryve foam may fit into clinician-led seborrheic dermatitis care. Kyn Skyn does not sell or guarantee specific medications.
    {%- elsif page.handle == 'ketoconazole' -%}Educational guide to how ketoconazole cream, shampoo, and foam may fit into clinician-led care for Malassezia-related skin concerns.
    {%- elsif page.handle == 'fungal-acne' -%}Fungal acne (Malassezia folliculitis) treated online by board-certified dermatologists. Get a diagnosis, a prescription when appropriate, and a routine that keeps the bumps from coming back.
    {%- elsif page.handle == 'seb-derm-dandruff' -%}Seborrheic dermatitis and dandruff treated online by board-certified dermatologists. Get a diagnosis, a prescription when appropriate, and a maintenance routine that holds.
    {%- elsif page.handle == 'tinea-versicolor' -%}Tinea versicolor treated online by board-certified dermatologists. Clear the yeast, even out the patches over time, and cut down on seasonal flares with an ongoing routine.
    {%- elsif page_description != blank -%}{{ page_description | escape }}
